          "text": "On examination: temperature 38.6, respiratory rate 26, sats 89% on room air, coarse crackles at right base.\n\nChest X-ray: right lower lobe consolidation.\n\nCRP 180. WCC 16.\n\nSats improved to 93% on room air on day 5.",
